WEBVTT

00:00:26.511 --> 00:00:27.928
(DOOR OPENING)

00:00:29.014 --> 00:00:30.431
(MAN SPEAKING FRENCH)

00:00:32.309 --> 00:00:33.350
(WOMAN SPEAKS FRENCH)

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.020
(BOTH SCREAM)

00:01:01.797 --> 00:01:04.632
This will be suitable
after a thorough cleanse.

00:01:06.843 --> 00:01:09.261
I want you to go to the circus now.

00:01:09.429 --> 00:01:11.555
Give my note to Credence.

00:01:11.723 --> 00:01:13.307
Begin his journey.

00:01:13.475 --> 00:01:16.560
When we've won,
they'll flee cities in the millions.

00:01:17.145 --> 00:01:18.479
They've had their time.

00:01:18.647 --> 00:01:20.898
We don't say such things out loud.

00:01:21.233 --> 00:01:22.775
We want only freedom.

00:01:23.443 --> 00:01:25.194
Freedom to be ourselves.

00:01:25.779 --> 00:01:27.571
To annihilate non-wizards.

00:01:27.948 --> 00:01:29.907
Not all of them. Not all.

00:01:30.617 --> 00:01:32.451
We're not merciless.

00:01:33.578 --> 00:01:35.996
The beast of burden
will always be necessary.

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:38.082
(BOY SPEAKING FRENCH
IN THE DISTANCE)

00:01:45.799 --> 00:01:46.924
(BOY BABBLES)

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:30.134
(INDISTINCT CHATTERING)

00:02:31.845 --> 00:02:33.345
(CAR HORN HONKING)

00:02:44.524 --> 00:02:45.774
<i>Ventus.</i>

00:02:45.859 --> 00:02:47.234
- (WIND WHOOSHING)
- (GASPS)

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.530
(GRUNTING)

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:53.282
(PEOPLE MURMURING)

00:03:07.756 --> 00:03:08.964
(SIGHS)

00:03:28.860 --> 00:03:30.110
NEWT: Dumbledore.

00:03:32.447 --> 00:03:34.698
Were the less conspicuous
rooftops full, then?

00:03:34.783 --> 00:03:35.824
Hmm.

00:03:36.326 --> 00:03:38.661
I do enjoy a view.

00:03:40.247 --> 00:03:41.247
<i>Nebulus.</i>

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:47.962
How was it?

00:03:48.129 --> 00:03:50.506
NEWT: They're still convinced
that you sent me to New York.

00:03:50.882 --> 00:03:52.341
DUMBLEDORE: You told them I didn't?

00:03:52.842 --> 00:03:53.842
Yes.

00:03:54.219 --> 00:03:55.219
MAN: Evening.

00:03:55.303 --> 00:03:56.637
Even though you did.

00:03:59.307 --> 00:04:01.308
You told me where to find that
trafficked Thunderbird, Dumbledore.

00:04:01.476 --> 00:04:02.643
You knew that I would take him home,

00:04:02.811 --> 00:04:04.436
and you knew I'd have to
take him through a Muggle port.

00:04:04.604 --> 00:04:07.481
DUMBLEDORE: I've always felt an affinity
with the great magical birds.

00:04:07.565 --> 00:04:09.358
There's a story in my family

00:04:09.526 --> 00:04:13.237
that a phoenix will come
to any Dumbledore in desperate need.

00:04:13.405 --> 00:04:16.031
They say my great-grandfather had one.

00:04:17.075 --> 00:04:20.244
And that it took flight when he died,
never to return.

00:04:20.662 --> 00:04:22.788
With all due respect, Professor,
I don't believe for a minute

00:04:22.956 --> 00:04:24.957
that's why you told me
about the Thunderbird.

00:04:32.549 --> 00:04:34.508
Credence is in Paris, Newt.

00:04:35.218 --> 00:04:37.052
Trying to trace his real family.

00:04:38.263 --> 00:04:42.391
I take it you've heard the rumors
about who he really is.

00:04:42.559 --> 00:04:43.559
No.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:55.237
The pure-bloods think he's the last
of an important French line.

00:04:57.532 --> 00:04:59.533
A baby whom everyone thought lost.

00:05:00.327 --> 00:05:01.327
Not Leta's brother?

00:05:01.411 --> 00:05:02.661
That's what they're whispering.

00:05:03.413 --> 00:05:06.290
And pure-blood or not, I know this.

00:05:07.083 --> 00:05:09.501
An Obscurus grows in the absence of love

00:05:10.003 --> 00:05:12.254
as a dark twin, an only friend.

00:05:12.422 --> 00:05:16.258
If Credence has a real brother or sister
out there that can take its place,

00:05:16.926 --> 00:05:18.594
he might yet be saved.

00:05:19.679 --> 00:05:22.097
Wherever Credence is in Paris,
he's either in danger,

00:05:22.265 --> 00:05:24.058
or a danger to others.

00:05:24.726 --> 00:05:27.603
We may not know who he is yet,
but he needs to be found.

00:05:29.230 --> 00:05:32.149
And I rather hope
you might be the one to find him.

